{"id":8706,"ord":38,"n_segments":73,"prev":8705,"next":8707,"doc":{"id":"alma9945593556606326","title":"Father Al Lewis Interview, 1972-02-21","collection":"tulane","inst":"Tulane — Hogan Jazz Archive","interviewee":"Father Al Lewis","interviewer":"","date":"1972-02-21","year":1972,"source_url":"https://library.search.tulane.edu/permalink/01TUL_INST/4h6sc4/alma9945593556606326","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=alma9945593556606326"},"chapter":"On the road with Victor Spencer","title":"Victor Spencer's band and Shadowland","category":"band_or_employer","summary":"He lists band members, the Shadowland and Spencer's role.","period":"1920s","year_from":1920,"year_to":1929,"words":101,"start":[7,5],"end":[7,14],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=alma9945593556606326#s8706","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[{"name":"Shadowland","focus":1,"city":null}],"bands":[{"name":"Victor Spencer's band","focus":1,"leader":"Victor Spencer"},{"name":"Sonny South's band","focus":0,"leader":"Sonny South"}]},"people":[{"name":"Blake","qid":null,"n":3},{"name":"Alan Gaudet","qid":null,"n":1},{"name":"Victor Spencer","qid":null,"n":1}],"story":{"theme":34,"theme_name":"Who was in the band: naming sidemen and personnel","community":60,"community_name":"Who played in the band: reciting personnel","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":7,"b":5,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"Blake, Blake who?"},{"p":7,"b":6,"s":"Alfred Lewis","x":"Blake, Blake was his name."},{"p":7,"b":7,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"Blake."},{"p":7,"b":8,"s":"SPEAKER_03","x":"What did he play?"},{"p":7,"b":9,"s":"Alfred Lewis","x":"Drums."},{"p":7,"b":10,"s":"Alfred Lewis","x":"What's his first name? I can't remember, he used to have a Sonny South band down there. And he was with- He was the manager of the band or the leader of the band? No. Victor Spencer was the manager of the band. The man got to Shadowland, his son got out there. But Gordette wrote for me to come, told me about they had so many gigs."},{"p":7,"b":11,"s":"Richard B. 'Dick' Allen","x":"He's got the Shadowland where?"},{"p":7,"b":12,"s":"Alfred Lewis","x":"Out there on Dan Hill and Washington. Oh that one."},{"p":7,"b":13,"s":"Richard B. 'Dick' Allen","x":"Yeah."},{"p":7,"b":14,"s":"Alfred Lewis","x":"That's his son."}]}